                "text": "§0My granddaughter comes from the End with strange things.\nI sell them, she brings more.\nDon't ask where they come from.\n\n§e§lBUY §0(you give gems)\n§0Golden Apple §c-100\n§0Slimeball x4 §c-45\n§0Honey x2 §c-30\n§0Nether Wart x4 §c-30\n§0Golden Carrot x2 §c-75\n§0Chorus x4 §c-45\n§0Blaze Powder x4 §c-45\n§4Notch Apple §c-500\n§0Glow Berries x8 §c-22\n§0Torchflower x2 §c-55\n§0Cake §c-55\n§0Glow Ink Sac x8 §c-38\n§0Honeycomb x8 §c-35\n\n§d§lBOOKS\n§0Silk Touch §c-180\n§0Luck of Sea §c-150\n§0Lure III §c-125\n\n§a§lSELL §0(the NPC pays you)\n§0Sweet Berry x512 §a+1\n§0Melon x512 §a+1\n§0Cactus x512 §a+1\n§0Carrot x512 §a+1\n§0Potato x512 §a+1\n§0Pumpkin x384 §a+1\n§0Bamboo x512 §a+1\n\n§a§lFRUITS\n§0Strawberry x384 §a+1\n§0Banana x256 §a+1\n§0Coconut x128 §a+1\n§0Lemon x384 §a+1\n§0Orange x384 §a+1\n§0Grape x384 §a+1\n§0Pineapple x256 §a+1",
